WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:08.341
Oshikiri! What was that sound?

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:11.845
The door! The intruder
must've gone outside!

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:14.222
So the first floor! Let's go!

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:15.140
This way!

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.601
Wait a second!

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:22.230
Look.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:34.451
Isn't that…

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:39.539
Isn't that you, Oshikiri?

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:41.833
There's another Oshikiri?

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.543
What's he doing?

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:47.047
It's Oshikiri from an alternate dimension.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:51.009
In that dimension,
there's a world just like ours.

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:55.597
And in that world,
we each have someone just like ourselves.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.390
Hey, what's that?

00:00:57.474 --> 00:00:59.142
Wait. Is that a body?

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:03.354
Alternate-dimension Oshikiri
murdered someone in his world

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:05.065
and came to this world to bury them.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.066
That's crazy!

00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:11.863
You can get away with murder
if you bury the body in another dimension.

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:13.907
Shit!

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:16.284
What are you doing?

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:21.122
Hey! Stop that! This is my home!

